DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
15529::$$$message_0120_0000_0000$$$::I get to a hidden mansion that hides in a high place in the outskirts of Shinto.[lr]::
15530::$$$message_0120_0000_0001$$$::I know there isn't anything, but just in case, I want to investigate it one more time.::
15531::$$$message_0120_0001_0000$$$::"...I left right away last time, so I should take my time today."[lr]::
15532::$$$message_0120_0001_0001$$$::I'm well aware that this is trespassing, but I wanted to see the inside of the mansion for a bit without needing to rush.::
15533::$$$message_0120_0002_0000$$$::Both the Tohsaka house and Matou house are magnificent mansions, but I've never had any emotional attachments to the buildings themselves.[lr]::
15534::$$$message_0120_0002_0001$$$::However, I like this mansion for some odd reason.[lr]::
15535::$$$message_0120_0002_0002$$$::While being luxurious, the modest make hits the spot for architecture enthusiasts. If it's this mansion, it would seem fun to work as the manager as a part-time job.::
15536::$$$message_0120_0003_0000$$$::The mansion is filled with light.[lr]::
15537::$$$message_0120_0003_0001$$$::There must be a lot of windows.[lr]::
15538::$$$message_0120_0003_0002$$$::It's partly because it's near the top of a mountain, but on days when the weather is good, the field of view becomes white and hazy.[lr]::
15539::$$$message_0120_0003_0003$$$::In the middle of what seems to be heaven, there is some definite thing that wasn't there last time.[sestop time=1000 nowait=true]::
15540::$$$message_0120_0004_0000$$$::"...There's someone..."[lr]::
15541::$$$message_0120_0004_0001$$$::I feel the presence of someone on the second floor.[lr]::
15542::$$$message_0120_0004_0002$$$::It's not just someone's presence that I'm feeling.[lr]::
15543::$$$message_0120_0004_0003$$$::Something towards the intruder[line len=3]no, there is clear enmity towards me.::
15544::$$$message_0120_0005_0000$$$::I go up to the second floor.[lr]::
15545::$$$message_0120_0005_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
15546::$$$message_0120_0005_0002$$$::...I hear the sound of footsteps approaching.[lr]::
15547::$$$message_0120_0005_0003$$$::From the whiteout, he slowly shows himself...::
15548::$$$message_0120_0006_0000$$$::"...So it's your stupid face.[lr]::
15549::$$$message_0120_0006_0001$$$::Geez, what a waste of energy, Shirou Emiya."[lr]::
15550::$$$message_0120_0006_0002$$$::[shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-2]...That's my line.::
15551::$$$message_0120_0007_0000$$$::"I got nervous for no reason. Why are you here, Archer? Or what, did Tohsaka get fed up with you and kick you out?"[lr]::
15552::$$$message_0120_0007_0001$$$::"Hm. You have good instincts. You're not necessarily wrong.[lr]::
15553::$$$message_0120_0007_0002$$$::I couldn't finish the work that the owner asked me to do, and I haven't been able to go home satisfied these past few days..."::
15554::$$$message_0120_0008_0000$$$::"However, your speculation sounded credible.[lr]::
15555::$$$message_0120_0008_0001$$$::I see, being in a dilemma of not having a place to stay and running away probably isn't someone else's business.[lr]::
15556::$$$message_0120_0008_0002$$$::Worries that you hold about the future will involuntarily come out of your mouth. Narrow down your target like a man while you can still decide on your course of action."[lr]::
15557::$$$message_0120_0008_0003$$$::"...Guh, [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-2]that's none of your business. Stay out of it."::
15558::$$$message_0120_0009_0000$$$::Since even I get worried myself sometimes.[lr]::
15559::$$$message_0120_0009_0001$$$::...Putting that aside, Archer has certainly been watching over the Tohsaka house recently.[lr]::
15560::$$$message_0120_0009_0002$$$::Work that was left to Tohsaka must mean the duties of Fuyuki's administrator...it must be maintaining the peace of the town.::
15561::$$$message_0120_0010_0000$$$::"...Heh. Did you also think there was something here, too? You wouldn't get close to here if that weren't the case, right?"::
15562::$$$message_0120_0011_0000$$$::"No. I'm not interested in this mansion at all, and first of all, I didn't even know of its existence. I just finished investigating, but there was nothing particularly unusual. I don't plan to waste any more time here."[lr]::
15563::$$$message_0120_0011_0001$$$::"Huh??? Then why did you come? You came because you thought it was suspicious, right?"::
15564::$$$message_0120_0012_0000$$$::"You're the reason. You came into this mansion before. That's enough reason to investigate."[lr]::
15565::$$$message_0120_0012_0001$$$::"What the hell? Does that mean you came to see if I did anything bad?"[lr]::
15566::$$$message_0120_0012_0002$$$::I glare at him, wondering on what basis he's suspecting me.[lr]::
15567::$$$message_0120_0012_0003$$$::After Archer looks me up and down suspiciously,::
15568::$$$message_0120_0013_0000$$$::"What brings [font italic=true]you[font italic=false] here?[lr]::
15569::$$$message_0120_0013_0001$$$::You said so yourself that you didn't know about this mansion."[lr]::
15570::$$$message_0120_0013_0002$$$::...Archer...didn't know about it.[lr]::
15571::$$$message_0120_0013_0003$$$::It dawns on me that this must mean something...[lr]::
15572::$$$message_0120_0013_0004$$$::"Hrrk..."[lr]::
15573::$$$message_0120_0013_0005$$$::I'm dazzled by the bright sunlight that shines.::
15574::$$$message_0120_0014_0000$$$::"Whatever, it will eventually become clear. Either that or I was expecting that there would be some kind of lead here, but it seems like I was wrong.[lr]::
15575::$$$message_0120_0014_0001$$$::...I suppose I can't gather all the evidence by myself."[lr]::
15576::$$$message_0120_0014_0002$$$::Archer heads to the hallway.::
15577::$$$message_0120_0015_0000$$$::"Oh yeah. The owner of this mansion passed away sixty years ago.[lr]::
15578::$$$message_0120_0015_0001$$$::The owner's name is Edelfelt. Apparently it's a distinguished family of mages from a faraway foreign country. [lr]::
15579::$$$message_0120_0015_0002$$$::"Edelfelt...?"[lr]::
15580::$$$message_0120_0015_0003$$$::...I feel like I've heard that name before...::
15581::$$$message_0120_0016_0000$$$::"Well then. I don't know what you came to look for in this mansion, but let me know if you find something new.[lr]::
15582::$$$message_0120_0016_0001$$$::Let's see, my theory would come to life if you discovered a corpse or something."[lr]::
15583::$$$message_0120_0016_0002$$$::He leaves with sarcasm.::
15584::$$$message_0120_0017_0000$$$::"What the hell is wrong with him? As if I would tell him even if I found something."[lr]::
15585::$$$message_0120_0017_0001$$$::I return the usual parting shot and start investigating the mansion.[lr]::
15586::$$$message_0120_0017_0002$$$::...Well.[lr]::
15587::$$$message_0120_0017_0003$$$::Seeing as Archer couldn't find anything after investigating, it doesn't seem like new evidence will come up no matter how much I look.::
915548::$$$message_9120_0006_0000$$$::"...So it's your stupid face. Geez, what a waste of energy, Shirou Emiya."[r]X ¼